            <p class="project-p"> <span class="bold">"There's not an easy way to find what the page selling"</span></p>
            <p class="project-p"> <span class="bold">"The site doesn't look as fun as I'd like it too"</span></p>
            <p class="project-p"> <span class="bold">"The second section feels like an advertisement"</span></p>
           
    
    
        </div>
        <img src="" id="gif" alt="">
